Package: pycentric-cordon
Version: 1.0.0
Section: security
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34), bubblewrap (>= 0.8.0), iproute2, iptables
Recommends: apparmor (>= 4.0), mitmproxy
Maintainer: PyCentric Security Architecture <security@pycentric.co.za>
Homepage: https://pycentric.co.za
Description: Universal 5-Gate Host Sandbox and L3/L4/L7 Network Inspection Engine
 Cordon enforces defense-in-depth containment for autonomous coding agents
 (OpenCode, Antigravity, Claude Code), untrusted Python/uv scripts, and
 isolated package builds using Bubblewrap namespaces, AppArmor 4.0 userns
 mediation, Linux network namespaces, and L7 HTTP/HTTPS secret-leak inspection.
